me>Kinghorn</surname><given-names>AD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Gummiferol, a cytotoxic polyacetylene from the leaves of <italic>Adenia gummifera</italic></article-title><source>Journal of Natural Product</source><year>1995</year><volume>58</volume><fpage>1625</fpage><lpage>1628</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8676132</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1021/np50124a027</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rang</surname><given-names>HP</given-names></name><name><surname>Dale</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>Ritter</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Moore</surname><given-names>PK</given-names></name></person-group><source>Pharmacology</source><year>2003</year><publisher-name>Churchill Livingstone, Edinburgh</publisher-name><fpage>219</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cheeseman</surname><given-names>KH</given-names></name><name><surname>Scater</surname><given-names>TF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Free radical in medicine</article-title><source>British Medical Bulletin</source><year>2003</year><volume>49</volume><publisher-name>Churchill Livingstone, London</publisher-name><fpage>479</fpage><lpage>724</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lollinger</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><source>Free radicals and food additives</source><year>1981</year><publisher-name>Taylor and Francis London</publisher-name><fpage>21</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tutour</surname><given-names>BL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Antioxidative activities of algal extracts</article-title><source>Synergistic effect with vitamin E Phytochemistry</source><year>1990</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>3759</fpage><lpage>3765</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Raj</surname><given-names>KJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Shalini</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Flavonoids-a review of biological activities</article-title><source>Indian Drugs</source><year>1999</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>668</fpage><lpage>676</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Badami</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Gupta</surname><given-names>MK</given-names></name><name><surname>Suresh</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Antioxidant activity of the ethanolic extract of <italic>Striga orobanchioides</italic></article-title><source>Journal of Ethnopharmacology</source><year>2003</year><volume>85</volume><fpage>227</fpage><lpage>230</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12639745</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0378-8741(03)00021-7</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Masika</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Afolayan</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>An ethnobotanical study of plants used for the treatment of livestock diseases in the Eastern Cape Province, South Africa</article-title><source>Pharmaceutical Biology</source><year>2003</year><volume>41</volume><fpage>16</fpage><lpage>21</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1076/phbi.41.1.16.14694</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Taylor</surname><given-names>RSL</given-names></name><name><surname>Edel</surnam